AWEN 0.1

PROJECT Example Novel
OUTPUT complete novel manuscript
ROOT .

SOURCES
  STORY       ./sources/story.md       AUTHORITATIVE
  CHARACTERS  ./sources/characters.md  AUTHORITATIVE
  STYLE       ./sources/style.md       AUTHORITATIVE
  RESEARCH    ./sources/research/      CONTEXT

REQUIRE
  consistent point of view
  continuity across chapters
  preserve locked story events

PREFER
  vivid concrete prose
  scene-led structure

AVOID
  exposition that repeats known information

APPROVAL
